    "body": "First standalone tester release for Polarity's Bitwig mods.\n\n- **Piano Roll: Scale Fold** 0.1.0-dev.4\n- **Piano Roll: Step Sequencer** 0.1.0-dev.5\n\nDownload the individual ZIPs under **Assets**, leave them zipped, and import them with **Mods → Add Mod…** in [Patchbay 0.36.0-dev.14](https://github.com/shaboogen-dev/Patchbay/releases/tag/0.36.0-dev.14). Accept replacement if offered. If the old copy was installed in a folder with a different name, move that folder out of Patchbay's mods directory first. Enable the mods and click **Load**. Step Sequencer also needs the bundled **Framework: Piano Roll** enabled.\n\nEach mod ZIP contains its compiled helper.jar. The automatically generated **Source code** downloads do not.\n\nBoth ZIPs replaced source-only installs through Patchbay's importer and passed offline preparation together on Windows x64 with Bitwig Studio 6.1.3. Other versions and platforms were not verified for this release.\r\n"
